    <string name="how_it_works">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_it_works_text">Android does not tell apps how you unlocked, so UnlockWall guesses from how fast it was. A fast PIN could count as quick.\n\nIt is not a security lock. Do not use a picture that must never be seen. If your phone stops the app, the last picture stays.\n\nDo not use it with Extend Unlock (Smart Lock): a phone kept unlocked could show your Quick picture.</string>
